605
00:27:18,230 --> 00:27:20,490
So you can think of there
being two things here.

606
00:27:20,490 --> 00:27:24,920
There is one thing which is
v hat of pi hat star, which

607
00:27:24,920 --> 00:27:27,390
is its own estimate of
how good its value is.

608
00:27:27,390 --> 00:27:31,800
And then there is
the true value of it.

609
00:27:31,800 --> 00:27:34,400
And these in general are
going to be different,

610
00:27:34,400 --> 00:27:36,450
and these in particular
are going to be different

611
00:27:36,450 --> 00:27:39,090
if your estimated model is bad.

612
00:27:39,090 --> 00:27:40,780
So it's going to
think I'm doing great.

613
00:27:40,780 --> 00:27:43,950
This is going to help students
persist till the end of time.

614
00:27:43,950 --> 00:27:46,420
But if the model
is misspecified,

615
00:27:46,420 --> 00:27:48,310
meaning that even
with infinite data,

616
00:27:48,310 --> 00:27:52,020
it will not converge to the
true model of student learning,

617
00:27:52,020 --> 00:27:54,660
then that estimate
will be wrong.

618
00:27:54,660 --> 00:27:58,620
And as you might imagine here,
20 state model of human learning

619
00:27:58,620 --> 00:27:59,530
is not that great.

620
00:27:59,530 --> 00:28:00,030
Yeah.

621
00:28:00,030 --> 00:28:04,120
[INAUDIBLE] 10 state.

622
00:28:04,120 --> 00:28:05,120
Yeah.

623
00:28:05,120 --> 00:28:07,530
So it's not saying that--

624
00:28:07,530 --> 00:28:09,660
it's not saying that
some of these policies

625
00:28:09,660 --> 00:28:11,550
might not be good policies.

626
00:28:11,550 --> 00:28:13,260
What this was arguing to us--

627
00:28:13,260 --> 00:28:14,730
so it's a great question.

628
00:28:14,730 --> 00:28:16,800
It's not that inside of
these there might not be

629
00:28:16,800 --> 00:28:19,140
pretty decent policy classes.

630
00:28:19,140 --> 00:28:22,050
You could argue that education
works because there's

631
00:28:22,050 --> 00:28:23,180
decentish policies.

632
00:28:23,180 --> 00:28:24,930
I mean, I don't have
perfect models of all

633
00:28:24,930 --> 00:28:27,930
of you guys' learning, but
it's still sufficient for us

634
00:28:27,930 --> 00:28:29,830
to be able to learn
and communicate.

635
00:28:29,830 --> 00:28:32,760
What I'm arguing here is
that we should not just

636
00:28:32,760 --> 00:28:37,170
use the accuracy of
