638
00:28:42,270 --> 00:28:44,070
to pick.

639
00:28:44,070 --> 00:28:46,770
This is arguing that we need
separate independent estimates

640
00:28:46,770 --> 00:28:48,990
of really-- we want to
basically in some ways

641
00:28:48,990 --> 00:28:51,580
kind of like what we saw
