1170
00:59:17,450 --> 00:59:18,402
weighting.

1171
00:59:18,402 --> 00:59:20,360
What I learned about
them, I learned about them

1172
00:59:20,360 --> 00:59:21,883
as importance
sampling often also

1173
00:59:21,883 --> 00:59:23,300
depends whether
you're using these

1174
00:59:23,300 --> 00:59:25,460
to design ways to gather
data or whether you

1175
00:59:25,460 --> 00:59:27,220
have historical data.

1176
00:59:27,220 --> 00:59:30,190
OK, let's see how we can do
