1183
00:59:47,600 --> 00:59:50,000
from initial start
state times the reward

1184
00:59:50,000 --> 00:59:51,530
of those trajectories.

1185
00:59:51,530 --> 00:59:58,910
So this is the reward
of a trajectory tau.

1186
00:59:58,910 --> 01:00:04,230
This is the probability of a
trajectory under the desired

1187
01:00:04,230 --> 01:00:05,640
policy.

