01:00:59,160 --> 01:01:01,190
So now we know.

1203
01:01:01,190 --> 01:01:03,890
Let me put this from here.

1204
01:01:03,890 --> 01:01:08,060
We know from before that if we
have samples from our behavior

1205
01:01:08,060 --> 01:01:10,580
